# Only .github/, README.md, LICENSE, SECURITY.md, CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md,
# funding.json, and .well-known/ live at this level -- GitHub-platform
# discovery files that have to stay at the true repo root (see
# TrenTorch_CLI/README.md's own move history / PR that split this out).
# Everything else, including this repo's own build/tooling caches, now
# lives under TrenTorch_CLI/ and is covered by TrenTorch_CLI/.gitignore
# instead. This file only needs to cover things that can still appear at
# the true root regardless of that split.

# Claude Code's own session scratch/worktree directory -- a tool-local
# artifact, not project content, and unrelated to whatever lives inside
# TrenTorch_CLI/ or any future sibling directory.
.claude/
